#. ---- Spot the Bug: title, hint, achievements, daily challenge
msgid "Spot the Bug"
msgstr "Xatoni top"

msgid "click the line with the bug before the fuse burns down — the fix and the reason come after each one"
msgstr "pilik yonib bo'lmasidan xato bor qatorni bosing — har biridan keyin tuzatish va sababi ko'rsatiladi"

msgid "Bug hunter"
msgstr "Xato ovchisi"

msgid "Find 100 bugs in Spot the Bug"
msgstr "«Xatoni top» o'yinida 100 ta xatoni toping"

msgid "Clean review"
msgstr "Mukammal tekshiruv"

msgid "Find all ten bugs of a round, each at the first click"
msgstr "Raunddagi o'nta xatoning hammasini, har birini birinchi bosishda toping"

msgid "Daily reviewer"
msgstr "Har kungi tekshiruvchi"

msgid "Find the daily bug 7 days in a row"
