#, c-sharp-format
msgid "Daily snippet #{0}"
msgstr "Kun kodi #{0}"

msgid "The same snippet for everyone today, and one try at it. Find the bug in as few clicks and seconds as you can."
msgstr "Bugun hamma uchun bir xil kod va bitta urinish. Xatoni iloji boricha kamroq bosish va kamroq soniyada toping."

